RESULT.CBA.RESULT: CBA_I2c - #10
RESULT.CBA.NOTES
This loop is for hardware safety - to clear any stale data in RX FIFO.
It is difficult to achieve full MC/DC coverage in unit test because:
 1. It depends on actual hardware FIFO status (BUFSTAT.u6RXSTAT).
 2. The number of iterations is dynamic and hardware dependent.
Justification: Safety-critical FIFO flush. Covered in integration/hardware testing.
RESULT.CBA.NOTES_END
